Hi <%= @reservation.contact_name.presence || @reservation.user&.name %>,

Thanks for your reservation at Restaurant Reservation. Here are the details:

Date: <%= @reservation.formatted_date %>
Time: <%= @reservation.formatted_time %>
Party size: <%= @reservation.num_people %>


To view or modify your reservation, please sign in and visit "My Reservations".

We look forward to seeing you!

— Restaurant Reservation

<% if @guest_token.present? %>
Guest access link (valid until <%= @reservation.guest_token_expires_at.strftime('%B %d, %Y') if @reservation.guest_token_expires_at %>):
<%= reservation_url(@reservation, guest_token: @guest_token) %>

Important: Guest users can view this reservation using the link above, but editing or cancelling is available only to registered users. To modify or cancel, please create an account (<%= signup_url %>) or sign in (<%= login_url %>) and use the "My Reservations" page.
<% end %>
